# Override the API base URL used by the popup.
# - Production builds (`npm run build`) bake the prod URL from popup.ts
#   into the bundle. You do not need to set anything for prod.
# - For local development, copy this file to `.env.local` (which is
#   already gitignored) and uncomment the line below to point the
#   extension at a locally-running API server.
#
# `npm run dev` runs vite with --mode development, which also causes
# the dev-only host permission (http://localhost:3000) to be injected
# into the built manifest.json automatically.

# VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:3000
